title: Act_III_Forward
tags:
---
Heart: We’ve always been together, as far as I can remember. You were the lazy one who hated moving.

Mind: And you were the crazy kid. I still remember the day you discovered you could shatter glass.

Heart: And the day you realized you could control the blokes.

Mind: Hah

Heart: What I mean is... every discovery about ourselves came from exploring.

Mind: …

Heart: It’s the adventure—the unknown—that gave us more than we ever expected.

Heart: We've become closer than ever Don’t be worried. I’ll be here with you again, forever.

Mind: …You always find your way back to me Let's hit the road.
